<title>USA: F&amp;M National sets odd lot share buyback.</title>
<headline>F&amp;M National sets odd lot share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WINCHESTER, Va 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M National Corp Tueday said it has offering to buy back outstanding shares of from stockholders of less than 100 shares at the close of business on January 16, 1997.</p>
<p>The purposes of the offer is to reduce the number of stockholder accounts and in turn reduce expenses attributable to printing and distributing annual reports, quarterly reports and proxy solicitation materials and to enable owners of a small number of shares of the Common Stock to dispose of their shares without incurring brokerage commissions, they said.</p>
</text>
